* Fixed wanted waveform + independent CW -> real BAT85 control
BREPLAY drive 0 V=0.167621561827946*cos(2*pi*30980000*time+0.0859295112083987)+0.680211369973958*cos(2*pi*31000000*time+-1.49357215614685)+0.167693463925682*cos(2*pi*31020000*time+-3.06810447673501)+0.601058633731322*cos(2*pi*29000000*time+-0.911843412905378)
RS drive rf 50
* Actual Nexperia BAT85 manufacturer model; not BAT85S
RCONNECT rf an 0.1
XDET an det BAT85
RDET det 0 4700
CDET det 0 100p
RFILT det out 4700
CFILT out 0 100p
RLOAD out 0 100000
.SUBCKT BAT85 1 2
